{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/699784c989c3db382520e6f92819e062d239f504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is the altitude to the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8fe61d9d20e070fbd02e581eca23118337b50ee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{DF}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> is the altitude to the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e33fe7d65facd8868f58b6e94ddc7f153a5a3f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />. [<b>Note:</b> <i>Both pictures represent the same parallelogram.</i>]  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9f476d54e7646df2ec0a8ac3abbd926fee29e89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7b192872f3b77810026193fe1a80a9e9b76ed9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c6469ca9f9686e080e7794af0d13b24e70416ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE=6$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8dfae5d614a6a0ff380e5464da6b006c8f44dc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF=$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2bbb0a9b55e0060cb42c71e75562e282f6032e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(12); pair A,B,C,D,P,Q,W,X,Y,Z; A = (0,0); B = (12,0); C = (20,6); D = (8,6); W = (18,0); X = (30,0); Y = (38,6); Z = (26,6); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(W--X--Y--Z--cycle); P = (8,0); Q = (758/25,6/25); dot(A); dot(B); dot(C); dot(D); dot(W); dot(X); dot(Y); dot(Z); dot(P); dot(Q); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(W--X--Y--Z--cycle); draw(D--P); draw(Z--Q); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NW); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,P,S); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,W,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,X,S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,Y,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,Z,NW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,Q,E); [/asy]\" width=\"805\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/5/4f5a0757719ea96b551df5cbae707b4c84eca8c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6.4 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 7.2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"367\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/2563dee5a3a40f36e69e99d4a32be4ae771268c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC \\cdot DE = 12 \\cdot 6 = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"182\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/3/543fc9ba339a1ed823fa6d56fb5b39f73fa88401.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE = 6$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d8fac81486a46f335a168e5efe686bdc72c99f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = AB - BE = 12-4=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"241\" height=\"16\" />, by the Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c2ca47b2f4fe7916d24137361cbdc913a5b0b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = \\sqrt{6^2+8^2}=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"168\" height=\"21\" />.  \n</p><p>Since the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> can also be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f536ab9eb9f11e67c2d6e66cd04cc474ffc5a022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD \\cdot DF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2c0a5f5c34246ca5dd2451a6cea96e1fb28c991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot DF = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd644ae6acbe76a1ef5b7cd2e7359a30e1100b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"125\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Jonathan Miller, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bbaac3a57fb3d1722d09e5ba9449f0cad793d0a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = 12 - 4 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />, by the Pythagorean theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5254560a42b438dd774712487f30473f017b0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = \\sqrt{6^2 + 8^2} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"168\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b88051cb73d16f29010154d74a11f69bd621f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = \\angle C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8ff5909450eb51ba283bd627b95bbc0e5d3b638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DEA = \\angle DFC = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/b/bab7d38c35d3c10486b13eaf4c56c6b3e6a92c6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEA \\sim \\triangle DFC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.  \n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3ffa2c537fb7d678314c029f9d3755b4d9f3c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{DE}{DA} = \\frac{DF}{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce8c24eb0fe5cd34f6f591cbb57ecce178dae2aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{10} = \\frac{DF}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"39\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd644ae6acbe76a1ef5b7cd2e7359a30e1100b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"125\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a hr